# The release image is built from a context GoReleaser stages (the prebuilt
# binaries plus `extra_files`), and the local build described in docs/docker.md
# stages a context of the same shape by hand - so neither build sees the
# repository itself. This file only matters when someone points `docker build`
# at the repository root anyway; keep it narrow enough that the two paths cannot
# diverge silently.
.git
.github
dist
site
coverage.out
tommy
*.test
test
website
docs
plugins/**/testdata
